<view class="screen"><view class="mode-banner">{{modeLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{imageError}}" class="note">部分图片暂时无法读取，请稍后刷新。商品和订单信息以文字为准。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取好物…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">重新读取</button><button class="text-button" data-page="mine" bindtap="go">前往我的</button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="section-title"><text class="page-title">把喜欢的带回家</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh">刷新</button></view><text class="body-copy">同一采购者的商品一起结算；不同店铺分别下单。</text><view wx:if="{{empty}}" class="empty"><text>购物车还没有好物</text><button class="primary" data-page="home" bindtap="go">去挑好物</button></view><view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:for-item="group" wx:key="id" class="surface"><view class="section-title"><text class="product-title">{{group.name}}</text><button wx:if="{{group.id !== 'unavailable'}}" class="text-button" data-id="{{group.id}}" bindtap="selectShop" disabled="{{processing}}">只选这家</button></view><view wx:for="{{group.rows}}" wx:key="key" class="cart-row"><button aria-label="{{item.selected ? '取消选择' : '选择'}}{{item.product}}" class="check-button {{item.selected ? 'checked' : ''}}" data-product="{{item.productId}}" data-variant="{{item.variant}}" data-action="select" bindtap="changeRow" disabled="{{processing}}">{{item.selected ? '✓' : ''}}</button><image binderror="imageFailed" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill" data-id="{{item.productId}}" bindtap="openProduct"/><view class="grow"><text class="product-title">{{item.product}}</text><text class="muted small">{{item.label}} · {{item.weight}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.unavailable}}" class="warning small">缺货或暂不可购买，可取消选择或移除</text><text wx:else class="muted small">当前余 {{item.stock}} 份</text><view class="section-title"><text class="price">¥{{item.priceText}}</text><view class="stepper"><button data-product="{{item.productId}}" data-variant="{{item.variant}}" data-action="-1" bindtap="changeRow" disabled="{{processing || item.quantity <= 1}}">−</button><text>{{item.quantity}}</text><button data-product="{{item.productId}}" data-variant="{{item.variant}}" data-action="1" bindtap="changeRow" disabled="{{processing || item.quantity >= 10}}">＋</button></view></view><button class="text-button remove" data-product="{{item.productId}}" data-variant="{{item.variant}}" data-action="remove" bindtap="changeRow" disabled="{{processing}}">移除</button></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!empty}}" class="fixed-actions"><view class="grow"><text class="small muted">已选 {{count}} 份 · 运费结算时确认</text><text class="price">¥{{totalText}}</text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="checkout" disabled="{{processing || !count}}">去结算</button></view></view><view class="bottom-space"></view></view>
